  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Asilvorcarp/ApexMC/raw/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/apex_mc/icon.png\" alt=\"图标\"></p><h1>ApexMC</h1><p>让MC重归巅峰。</p><h2>标记系统</h2><p>默认快捷键：<code>Z</code></p><p>向队友发送信号以进行沟通。</p><p>在标记点上再次按下快捷键可取消标记。</p><h2>图片展示</h2><p>来自队友的标记：</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Asilvorcarp/ApexMC/raw/1.19.2/images/pingFromTeammate.png\" alt=\"队友标记\"></p><p>夜晚时的标记：</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Asilvorcarp/ApexMC/raw/1.19.2/images/pingAtNight.png\" alt=\"夜间标记\"></p><h2>前置模组</h2><p>malilib：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malilib\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malilib</a></p>",
